      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>layering new hobbies or volunteering... it just feels so hollow. like, why bother trying to build a \"new\" version of myself when the only version that actually mattered is gone? i spent twenty years becoming this person. now i'm just a shell. it's not like i can just start over from scratch. it feels more like the story is just over. there's no plot left, no direction. just this empty, pointless cycle of waking up every day.",
